      "label": "Told heron",
      "data": {
        "condition": "The player asks Hobb where he works, or where he's due at the bell, what goes on there tonight or how a body gets in, or Hobb tells it. No dice: the loft is out, and the rest comes as he's asked. He tells his own part of the night as he knows it: the Heron warehouse, at the downriver end of the wharves, re-sacking ('It's the King's grain, sir. Everyone knows. Nobody says.'); tonight's a loading night, with a barge for Saltmere; he's due on the hoist at the eleventh bell, the gang go in at the river door off the plank walk, showing a brass heron token at its grille, and the Master comes at the midnight bell to see the barge off.",
        "phase": "outcome",
        "skill": "",
        "dc": 0,
        "scope": "beat",
        "branch": "direct",
        "outcomeText": "",
        "sourceRoute": {
          "id": "told-heron",
          "when": "The player asks Hobb where he works, or where he's due at the bell, what goes on there tonight or how a body gets in, or Hobb tells it. No dice: the loft is out, and the rest comes as he's asked. He tells his own part of the night as he knows it: the Heron warehouse, at the downriver end of the wharves, re-sacking ('It's the King's grain, sir. Everyone knows. Nobody says.'); tonight's a loading night, with a barge for Saltmere; he's due on the hoist at the eleventh bell, the gang go in at the river door off the plank walk, showing a brass heron token at its grille, and the Master comes at the midnight bell to see the barge off.",
          "to": "confession",
          "establishes": [
            "The player knows that Hobb does night work at the Heron warehouse, at the downriver end of the wharves."
          ]
        },
        "establishes": [
          "The player knows that Hobb does night work at the Heron warehouse, at the downriver end of the wharves."
        ]
      }
