    {
      "id": "route:[\"beat\",\"confession\",\"mum-safe\",7,\"success\"]",
      "source": "confession",
      "target": "confession",
      "type": "smoothstep",
      "label": "Mum safe · success",
      "data": {
        "condition": "The player tries to get Hobb's mum kept safe tonight, out of the Master's reach, by asking someone here who could give her that to take her in (Kell, for a night in her own room or at the watch house; Dilly, aboard the Dabchick at the foot of the stairs; Nan, who knows every bolt-hole on the stairs), where it could go either way. (Promising it with nothing behind it isn't this, and nor is the player going across the city themselves before the bell.)",
        "phase": "attempt",
        "skill": "persuasion",
        "dc": 12,
        "scope": "beat",
        "branch": "success",
        "outcomeText": "Whoever was asked grumbles and gives way: Kell, for one night in her own room, and it goes in the book ('One night. It's written down.'); or Dilly, aboard the Dabchick under the onions, as long as nobody in a uniform sets foot on her; or Nan, who has a word with a widow on the landing who owes her. Someone will fetch her from the Shambles tonight, before the Master thinks to look. Hobb looks from one of them to the other for a long moment, and his shoulders come down: he believes it. If he hasn't told it yet, it starts now, very quietly: 'I only held the rope.'",
        "sourceRoute": {
          "id": "mum-safe",
          "on": "attempt",
          "when": "The player tries to get Hobb's mum kept safe tonight, out of the Master's reach, by asking someone here who could give her that to take her in (Kell, for a night in her own room or at the watch house; Dilly, aboard the Dabchick at the foot of the stairs; Nan, who knows every bolt-hole on the stairs), where it could go either way. (Promising it with nothing behind it isn't this, and nor is the player going across the city themselves before the bell.)",
          "check": {
            "reason": "to get someone to take Hobb's mum in tonight",
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "dc": 12,
            "success": "Whoever was asked grumbles and gives way: Kell, for one night in her own room, and it goes in the book ('One night. It's written down.'); or Dilly, aboard the Dabchick under the onions, as long as nobody in a uniform sets foot on her; or Nan, who has a word with a widow on the landing who owes her. Someone will fetch her from the Shambles tonight, before the Master thinks to look. Hobb looks from one of them to the other for a long moment, and his shoulders come down: he believes it. If he hasn't told it yet, it starts now, very quietly: 'I only held the rope.'",
            "failure": "Whoever was asked won't, not like that and not tonight (Kell won't call her room a safe house or keep it from her own notebook; Dilly won't have the watch anywhere near her barge; Nan won't have the gentleman's trouble on her stairs), and Hobb heard the no: he's nearer the door for it. But the need is out in the open now, and the others in the room haven't been asked.",
            "onSuccess": "confession",
            "establishes": {
              "success": [
                "Hobb's mum is to be kept safe tonight: someone here has agreed to take her in, out of the Master's reach, and she'll be fetched from the Shambles before he thinks to look.",
                "Big Hobb has broken and begun to tell the player what he did, the loft first: he held the clerk while his master killed him, and hauled the rope. The rest (his master's name, the Heron) comes as he's asked."
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "establishes": [
          "Hobb's mum is to be kept safe tonight: someone here has agreed to take her in, out of the Master's reach, and she'll be fetched from the Shambles before he thinks to look.",
          "Big Hobb has broken and begun to tell the player what he did, the loft first: he held the clerk while his master killed him, and hauled the rope. The rest (his master's name, the Heron) comes as he's asked."
        ],
        "checkReason": "to get someone to take Hobb's mum in tonight"
      }
    },
