      "target": "confession",
      "type": "smoothstep",
      "label": "Kind to cob",
      "data": {
        "condition": "The player does Cob a kindness with nothing asked back: stands him his dinner or an extra bowl with no strings, or gives it freely after he's eaten. He takes it with bad grace and a boast, and it counts with him: after it, a polite ask for a look in his boot, out of the big cove's sight, gets a yes.",
        "phase": "outcome",
