            "states": [
              "closed"
            ],
            "description": "Low, heavy and rehung twenty years ago at the watch's expense (allegedly)."
          },
          {
            "id": "rules-board",
            "name": "the rules board",
            "kind": "feature",
            "in": "doorway",
            "at": [
              2,
              14
            ],
            "size": "medium",
            "material": "wood",
            "tags": [
              "sign"
            ],
            "description": "THE DROWNED RAT. RULES OF THE HOUSE. 1. No credit. 2. No blades out. 3. No fighting indoors. 4. No watch on duty. 5. No singing before the ninth bell. 6. What's said in the Rat stays in the Rat. 7. Gossip sold by the measure. By order, N. Quill. Enforced by Manners."
